            <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    <strong>Dr. Rahul Chandel</strong> is an esteemed medical professional currently serving as the <strong>Officiating Principal and Controller</strong> of Government Medical College, Bundi, a prestigious responsibility he assumed on June 27, 2026.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Holding a regular appointment as an <strong>Associate Professor in the Department of General Medicine</strong>, Dr. Chandel joined the institution on June 21, 2023. Prior to this, he served a dedicated tenure as an Assistant Professor at Government Medical College, Kota for over a decade.
                </p>
                <p>
                    He completed his <strong>MBBS</strong> from RNT Medical College, Udaipur in 2003, followed by his <strong>MD in General Medicine</strong> from JLN Medical College, Ajmer in 2009. His profound clinical expertise and vast teaching experience play a crucial role in advancing medical education, patient care, and the overall institutional growth at GMC Bundi.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
